<LegalPage title="Privacy policy" updated="15 September 2026"
           description="How IMMRSV handles personal information on this website.">
  <p>This policy explains what personal information IMMRSV collects through this website, how it is used, and the choices you have.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>This website does not use cookies, analytics or advertising trackers, and it has no accounts or forms. We only receive personal information when you contact us yourself — by email or by phone — in which case we receive your name, your contact details and whatever you choose to tell us.</p>
  <p>Like any website, the server that delivers these pages may keep short-lived technical logs (such as IP address and browser type) to keep the site running and secure.</p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>We use what you send us to reply to you, to discuss and deliver a project, and to keep a record of our correspondence. We do not sell or rent personal information, and we do not use it for marketing without your permission.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>Only with the services we use to run our business — for example, our email provider and website host — and only as far as they need it to provide that service, or where the law requires it.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep correspondence for as long as it is useful for the conversation or project it belongs to, and for any period the law requires.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us what personal information we hold about you, and ask us to correct or delete it. Depending on where you live — including California, under the CCPA — you may have further rights. Write to us and we will respond within the time the law allows.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>IMMRSV, Los Angeles. <a href="mailto:hello@immrsv.studio">hello@immrsv.studio</a></p>
</LegalPage>
